    <briefdescription>
<para>Wave D — Voice Pipeline Dedicated Benchmark Gates. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Benchmark gates VO-BM-01..04 for the voice module.</para>
<para>Gates: VO-BM-01 STT_Transcription_Throughput — ≥ 500 ops/sec VO-BM-02 TTS_Synthesis_Latency — p99 ≤ 50 ms VO-BM-03 AudioChunkQueue_Push_Throughput — ≥ 10 000 ops/sec VO-BM-04 StreamSession_Send_Latency — p99 ≤ 1 ms</para>
<para>SIMULATION NOTE: All STT, TTS, and streaming operations use in-process stubs that model the production hot paths without requiring real audio models or hardware backends. These stubs MUST NOT be used in production code paths.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>docs/operability/RUNBOOK_VOICE_PIPELINE.md </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>src/voice/ROADMAP.md — Wave D </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
